{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wgc-e-3-e1","title":"姜维遣廖化结营以持艾","order":5638,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-3-e1","label":"正文 · 三日","text":"姜维遣廖化结营以持艾","evidence":["wgc-q0330","wgc-q0038"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0050","role":"遣廖化","evidence":["wgc-q0330","wgc-q0038"]},{"person":"luxun-p0019","role":"自白水南向艾结营","evidence":["wgc-q0330","wgc-q0038"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0080","role":"屯白水北","evidence":["wgc-q0330","wgc-q0038"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"三日","precision":"undated","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0330","wgc-q0038"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0330"}],"persons":[{"id":"luxun-p0019","name":"廖淳","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0050","name":"姜维","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0080","name":"邓艾","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0038","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-61c55ec2fcc7429f6a8e","layer":"original","quote":"三日，维遣廖化，自白水南向艾结营。艾谓诸将曰：“维今猝还，吾军人少，法当来渡而不作桥〖2〗。此维使化持吾〖3〗，令不得还；维必自东袭取洮城〖4〗。”洮城在水北，去艾屯六十里。艾即夜潜军径到，维果来渡；而艾先至据城，得以不败。赐爵关内侯，加讨寇将军。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":263,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0330","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-61c55ec2fcc7429f6a8e","layer":"original","quote":"三日，维遣廖化，自白水南向艾结营","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":263,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
